cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this simulator in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Virtual Standardized Patient Simulator"
abstract: >-
  A program for practicing a clinical consultation with a simulated patient. An AI model
  plays the patient and runs offline on the learner's own computer. The examination findings,
  the clock, and the marking come from openly licensed OSCE case files.
authors:
